再爱（波兰）国了 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"625602245\" href=\"#/post/625602245\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-38\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-38\">↩</a> 渐进阅读 <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/incremental_reading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/incremental_reading</a></li><li id=\"ref-39\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-39\">↩</a> 睡眠好，学习好，生活好 <a href=\"http://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/424949741\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/424949741</a></li><li id=\"ref-40\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-40\">↩</a> 规划一个轻松的高效日 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"574512601\" href=\"#/post/574512601\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-41\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-41\">↩</a> 强制学校教育 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"351869026\" href=\"#/post/351869026\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-42\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-42\">↩</a> 教育改革 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"242815901\" href=\"#/post/242815901\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-43\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-43\">↩</a> 我在文章中为什么要使用比喻？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"583216628\" href=\"#/post/583216628\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-44\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-44\">↩</a> 学习的基本规律 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"272801606","title":"论老鼠比受过学校教育的人更优越","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":36,"minutes":5,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"306014650","title":"老汤比喻","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":36,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"92640205","title":"01 前言","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":27,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"99505568","title":"05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":20,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"456